# Force LF line endings for scripts regardless of the checkout platform's
# core.autocrlf setting -- a CRLF shell script fails at the shebang line on
# Linux ("$'bash\r': No such file or directory"). Confirmed bug 2026-08-11:
# snc/linux/build.sh and snc/ios/build.sh had silently picked up CRLF (no
# .gitattributes existed to prevent it) and were unusable on a fresh Linux
# clone.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
